  "blurb": "Two goals, one ball, and nobody has hands. Run into the ball and it goes along in front of you; E kicks it and it rolls away along the ground, Q dashes. Kick off, score, back to the middle, first to three. If the ball ends up somewhere nobody can play it, the Room tab brings it back.",
